WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:02.356
Most image converters online want you to upload

2
00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:04.724
your photos to their server first This one

3
00:00:04.736 --> 00:00:07.007
never does Everything happens right here in

4
00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:09.748
