10
00:00:25.132 --> 00:00:27.957
Eighty-two is a sensible default Drag it down

11
00:00:28.137 --> 00:00:30.733
and the files get smaller You can resize too

12
00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:33.642
set a maximum width and every image is scaled

13
00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:36.490
